{"page":20044,"part":1,"text":"丶【点】如高峰之坠石。\n\nL【竖弯钩】似长空之初月。\n\n一【横】若千里之阵云。\n\n丨【竖】如万岁之枯藤。\n\n【斜钩】劲松倒折，落挂石崖。\n\n【横折钩】如万钧之弩发。\n\n丿【撇】利剑截断犀象之角牙。\n\n＼【捺】一被常三过笔。\n\n澄神静虑，端己正容，秉笔思生，临池志逸。虚拳直腕，指齐掌空，意在笔前，文向思后。分间布白，勿令偏侧。墨淡则伤神彩，绝浓必滞锋毫。肥则为钝，瘦则露骨，勿使伤于软弱，不须怒降为奇。四面停匀，八边具备，短长合度，粗细折中。心眼准程，疏密欹正。筋骨精神，随其大小。不可头轻尾重，无令左短右长，斜正如人，上称下载，东映西带，气宇融和，精神洒落，省此微言，孰为不可也。","eligible":true,"blockedReasons":[],"source":{"kind":"human-txt","page":20044,"part":1,"label":"wolai标准正文／原人工审核独有补充","verifiedBy":"项目负责人（本对话确认）","verifiedAt":"2026-10-22T07:57:06+00:00","revision":"ccc2313f90a3993b4c4835cb22b02f7ab22530f420a8ebf5212019f96d8d12ca","textSha256":"ccc2313f90a3993b4c4835cb22b02f7ab22530f420a8ebf5212019f96d8d12ca","fileSha256":"ccc2313f90a3993b4c4835cb22b02f7ab22530f420a8ebf5212019f96d8d12ca","txtPath":"annotation-data/wolai-txt/20044-wolai-21WzqnkphcfzNFw4rapqWS.txt","reviewCsvPath":"annotation-data/wolai-review.csv","standardCorpus":"wolai-standard","displayLabel":"八诀 · 八诀","sourceUrl":"https://www.wolai.com/mojiyi/21WzqnkphcfzNFw4rapqWS","originalPages":[],"positionStatus":"原图只作篇目参考；新版正文不声称与旧扫描逐字对齐","provenance":[{"start":0,"end":11,"sourceTextSha256":"40cd6fc97a94cada39861289acf35afc77cea799b60e689a628767aca97d5e06","id":"q9QYkYbAgoxKHr1A1vhz8t","page_id":"21WzqnkphcfzNFw4rapqWS","root_id":"21WzqnkphcfzNFw4rapqWS","work":"八诀","author":"欧阳询","type":"text","origin":"wolai-block","rawStart":0,"rawEnd":11},{"start":13,"end":26,"sourceTextSha256":"8c0dacfaef1b5d9c7085c473f6014a94e0e9fd0dfd167f558664eb0b50058a5e","id":"h3MxA9xAwUhAVzpWcN29N2","page_id":"21WzqnkphcfzNFw4rapqWS","root_id":"21WzqnkphcfzNFw4rapqWS","work":"八诀","author":"欧阳询","type":"text","origin":"wolai-block","rawStart":0,"rawEnd":13},{"start":28,"end":39,"sourceTextSha256":"becbf099202d4fbade5754a077e3905c960eefc2dd074d67e923221f2a8fefcf","id":"vScdXW6hHWQZd4yqhEreks","page_id":"21WzqnkphcfzNFw4rapqWS","root_id":"21WzqnkphcfzNFw4rapqWS","work":"八诀","author":"欧阳询","type":"text","origin":"wolai-block","rawStart":0,"rawEnd":11},{"start":41,"end